;; Allowlist for raw-splice params (:sql:/:snip:) in HugSQL .sql files under src/.
;; Shape: {"src/path/to/file.sql" #{"param-name"}}
;;
;; Currently empty on purpose: even dynamic ORDER BY is expressed with value
;; params (CASE no-op sort keys), so no query needs a splice. Adding an entry
;; requires that every value passed to the param comes from a closed set of
;; dev-authored string literals selected by keyed lookup -- never from input --
;; and that the PR defends the exception. Checked by ./bin/mage lint-raw-splices
;; (fast) and raw-splice-lint-test (CI).
{}
